## Source patch used to derive the standalone polymeric D0C.params file.
## Apply to Rosetta's built-in D-phenylalanine (DPHE/DPH), replace para HZ
## with chlorine, and expose the PDB/mmCIF code D0C.

NAME para_chloro

BEGIN_SELECTOR
PROPERTY PROTEIN
PROPERTY D_AA
NAME3 DPH
HAS_ATOMS CZ HZ
END_SELECTOR

BEGIN_CASE
SET_IO_STRING D0C X
SET_INTERCHANGEABILITY_GROUP D0C
ADD_ATOM  CL  Cl   X    -0.090
ADD_BOND  CZ  CL
DELETE_ATOM  HZ
SET_ICOOR  CL  179.911728  59.918243  1.740  CZ  CE1  CE2
DELETE_PROPERTY CANONICAL_AA
DELETE_PROPERTY CANONICAL_NUCLEIC
END_CASE
